{"id": "reczz28HJJL2NjFM", "order": 1, "images": ["/media/dc10086406a62e2171df00f3.jpeg"], "name": "POST ARCHIVE FACTION (PAF)2025 秋冬系列", "originalName": "", "termName": "低能量", "author": "", "year": "2025", "medium": "时尚", "collection": "巴黎时装周", "caption": "", "why": "模特穿着层叠的服装躺在床上，之后才缓缓起身走秀。", "whyLong": "", "scene": "", "detail": "", "method": "PAF 2025 秋冬这场秀最值得研究的，是它把“起床”变成了时装表演的一部分。\n传统走秀通常从模特迈出第一步开始。PAF 却让模特先躺在床上，再缓缓起身，进入行走状态。\n这就改变了观众观看服装的方式：衣服不再只是穿在一个精神饱满、准备展示自己的人身上，而是和身体刚刚苏醒时的姿态联系起来。", "twist": "", "absence": "", "extra": "https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-features/inside-otis-reddings-final-masterpiece-sittin-on-the-dock-of-the-bay-122170/ ; https://americansongwriter.com/on-this-day-in-1967-otis-redding-was-in-the-studio-recording-the-classic-song-he-wouldnt-live-to-see-reach-no-1/ ; https://www.smoothradio.com/features/the-story-of/dock-of-the-bay-otis-redding-meaning-lyrics-facts/", "official": "[https://techuntermagazine.com/postarchivefaction-aw25-pfwhighlights](https://techuntermagazine.com/postarchivefaction-aw25-pfwhighlights)"}